<title>USA: Southern York Cty SD, Pa., won by Boenning.</title>
<headline>Southern York Cty SD, Pa., won by Boenning.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boenning &amp; Scattergood, Inc said it won $5.075 million of Southern York County School District, Pa., general obligation bonds, Series A of 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.631 percent.</p>
</text>
